#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This data is equivalent to the 205/55 R18 Touring Tire, but is made using normalized tables.
#
#Normalized data is rescaled for a load rating of 550 kg (5394 N) for Fz and Fy. In this example, no scaling is done for slip.
#
#The agreement with the 205/55 R18 example should be almost exact because both use the same original data.
#
#The linked VS Commands scale all four tire tables using the same factor, a new parameter TIRE_LOAD_RATING with a value set to 550.
#
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

